flowchart LR
  MODEL[Analytic model + seed + ideal clock] --> RAW[Float32 samples + timestamps]
  SPEC[Typed graph + calibration + error/resource budgets] --> COMPILE[Reviewed compiler + deterministic planner]
  RAW --> PACKET[Bounded IZP1 packets / sequence + epoch + CRC]
  COMPILE --> PROCESS[Raw-host / calibrated-edge / filtered-edge]
  PACKET --> PROCESS
  PROCESS --> FIT[Ringdown estimate / reject unsuitable input]
  RAW --> REF[NumPy float64 + SciPy reference]
  REF --> NUMERIC[C processing agreement]
  PROCESS --> NUMERIC
  MODEL --> TRUTH[Analytic model truth comparison]
  FIT --> TRUTH
  FIT --> UI[Local simulation studio]
  TRUTH --> UI
  NUMERIC --> UI
  UI --> ZIP[Raw data + model + config + costs + source + manifest + recompute]
